NOTE ON THE UNIVERSITY CREST

The file figures/university_logo.png is the coat of arms of Makerere
University. It is included so that Makerere candidates can build the
template unchanged. It is the property of the university and is not covered
by the MIT licence above. If you are not submitting to Makerere University,
replace that file with your own institution's logo before use.
